      "evidence_grade": "B for the shape, from the profile's own sourced curve",
      "name": "shedding curve enters as shape only",
      "source": "data/pathogens/active_profiles.json sars_cov2_resp shedding_curve_log10 / asymptomatic_shedding_log10",
      "value": "shedding_curve_log10 shifted so the symptomatic peak is 0; the measured asymptomatic offset is preserved by shifting both curves by the same amount"
